      "nodeData": {
        "codeText": "from dataclasses import dataclass\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass ExpenseItem:\n    \u0022\u0022\u0022Miesi\u0119czny wydatek rodziny. kind: koszty \u017Cycia, zobowi\u0105zanie (rata, limit karty) albo inne.\u0022\u0022\u0022\n\n    LIVING = \u0022koszty \u017Cycia\u0022\n    OBLIGATION = \u0022zobowi\u0105zanie\u0022\n    OTHER = \u0022inne\u0022\n\n    name: str\n    monthly: float\n    kind: str\n",
